        "created_at": "2025-07-20T00:11:14.179514+00:00",
        "notes": "Main goal here is to stay alive and deal damage. [Wraith Renewal](item_bcfde4e9-a18e-4169-bbfc-6439b7a2615a) will help you stay alive as long as possible. Kills aren't important, but if you do get them, here, have a cookie \ud83c\udf6a.\n\nIf their team has any snipers (ie: Ashe), that's who I target first. If they don't then go for their supports. Mercy is my main priority. Ana is also a good target, but be careful of her sleep.\n\nIn general, figure out who's the squishiest and pressure them. I like going for their DPS first because that pulls at least one support away from the main fight.",
