        "notes": "[Nightcreeper](item_d13ac4bd-e7be-4c95-9715-08a475fb3486) is a MUST BUY. This is great for repositioning with Wraith Form since you'll likely be Wraith-ing out of the fight. \n\nIf you have enough money, then get [Onslaught](item_3588e700-0ee3-44d0-bfdb-d01ad8b9efaf). This helps deal more damage and if you land your headshots you should be able to chunk a DPS or Support down to half (assuming they don't have a tankier build).\n\nIf you don't have enough money, get [Nightcreeper](item_d13ac4bd-e7be-4c95-9715-08a475fb3486) and fill the rest of the slots with blue/green item, focusing on weapon power and survival.",
