        "cash_earned": 0,
        "created_at": "2025-07-20T00:11:14.179514+00:00",
        "notes": "For the second power, I usually go [Revolving Ruin](item_244760fb-c91f-4a03-a45b-848745835b51). However, I haven't tested it out with [Backstabber](item_74a5a7f4-ff45-4cbd-b7b0-9127e4000990) first. Both will work so feel free to choose whichever fits your playstyle more, but you will be getting the other one in R5.\n\n[Revolving Ruin](item_244760fb-c91f-4a03-a45b-848745835b51) will let you deal damage faster. But having [Backstabber](item_74a5a7f4-ff45-4cbd-b7b0-9127e4000990) lets you deal a large amount of damage on the first shot. This goes will with your TP as you'll use it to get behind them.\n\nYou'll want to get [Onslaught](item_3588e700-0ee3-44d0-bfdb-d01ad8b9efaf) if you haven't already. Once you have that, the build will start to come together. :3\n\nI've listed some optional items that may help depending on what you're facing. But your main goal is still the same: get in the back line, poke them down, Wraith out, come back and repeat. If your team is good, they should be able to capitalize on a DPS (and maybe Support) getting distracted by you. You can also switch it up when you Wraith out by playing up front with your tank before diving again.",
