        "notes": "Alright, so for this round, get the power you didn't choose in R3. If you followed the build, that would be [Backstabber](item_74a5a7f4-ff45-4cbd-b7b0-9127e4000990).\n\nFrom here I would pick up [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f). \n\nOther than that, feel free to get whatever. You might prefer to get [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) if you find that you are able to get them low but can't finish the job. This should add a little boost to your damage.\n\nThe only reason I prefer AS in these rounds is by now, the enemy team should be wary of you and might just dogpile you when you start shooting. Being able to dish out damage super fast allows me to use Wraith Form as get out faster.",
