        "notes": "If you're made it to R7, I hope you're doing alright. Have two cookies, \ud83c\udf6a\ud83c\udf6a :)\n\nFor the powers, it's completely up to you. Pick the one that will help you/your team. By default, I go [Shrouded Shrapnel](item_b7373fd2-69d3-453b-89f3-b5ce87dc0c3a) for the extra damage on the second poke.\n\nIf you're getting a ton of kills from diving, the [Spirited to Slay](item_e11c7adb-70b7-4816-8e31-2c94c600bfd5) is really good. For more survivability, [Strangle Step](item_5af641ec-a231-43ea-ac83-ea15a542e03c) is nice. The more I play, the more i tend to use my TP to go directly in so the extra life steal will help keep you alive.  [Silent as the Grave](item_a2787a6d-3bf5-4d08-b5a5-704aaa053e42) may be useful if the enemy team is constantly checking their flank.\n\nFor items, as long as you have [Nightcreeper](item_d13ac4bd-e7be-4c95-9715-08a475fb3486) , [Onslaught](item_3588e700-0ee3-44d0-bfdb-d01ad8b9efaf) , and [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f), feel free to build the other three as you see fit.",
